The issued summer weekend duty sheet is attached. Please replace the old desk=
 copy with this one.

Matthew's 19=E2=80=9322 July window and Sanjay's 9=E2=80=9312 August window h=
ave no agreed relief. After an unanswered call to the named primary, go strai=
